# Outlaws also include Assassins (Hired Blade, Human Assassin) and Warlocks (Sedgemoor Witch, Human Warlock): both are
# refused as targets while Ornithopter beside them, sharing none of the five types, is the legal one. Shoot the Sheriff
# is an instant: Bot1 casts it during Bot2's turn 4, after Bot2 has cast the Witch.

